## X-Spoken-Tombstone: 1
# A tombstone: no Lua at all. See tombstones/VoiceOverRedux/VoiceOverRedux.toc.
#
# X-Spoken-Tombstone is read by SpokenZones/Core.lua, which disables the old ZoneLore folder
# so it cannot narrate over the new addon. This folder holds no code to narrate with, and the
# client raises a dialog of its own at every attempt to disable an addon, so it says here that
# it is the placeholder rather than the addon. A .toc released before this field existed
# cannot carry it, which is what makes the answer trustworthy.
